<body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><div class="shell"><a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="AvenAI home"><span class="brand-mark">AI</span><span class="brand-word">AvenAI</span></a><div class="header-actions"><a class="btn btn-quiet" href="index.html">Back to product</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="account.html">Account</a></div></div></header>
<main class="legal-page" id="main-content"><div class="legal-shell"><section class="legal-hero"><div class="dash-kicker">Trust & legal</div><h1>Refunds & withdrawal</h1><p>Plain-language information about subscription cancellation, refunds and EU withdrawal rights for AvenAI</p><div class="legal-meta">Last updated: 1 October 2026</div></section><div class="legal-grid"><nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Legal and trust pages"><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="terms.html">Terms</a><a href="refunds.html" aria-current="page">Refunds</a><a href="cookies.html">Tracking</a><a href="security.html">Security</a><a href="accessibility.html">Accessibility</a></nav><article class="legal-content"><section class="legal-section"><h2>1. Subscriptions</h2><p>Paid AvenAI plans, when offered, are recurring subscriptions processed by Stripe. Cancelling stops future renewal; access normally continues until the end of the paid billing period unless a refund, reversal or applicable law requires otherwise.</p></section><section class="legal-section"><h2>2. EU withdrawal rights</h2><p>Where the statutory withdrawal right applies to your distance contract, EU consumers may notify withdrawal within 14 days of concluding the contract. Requesting immediate paid access does not, by itself, waive any statutory withdrawal or refund right. We do not rely on activation of a recurring subscription as full performance or on the request alone as a digital-content withdrawal waiver.</p><p>Notify the private support email stated in your purchase confirmation with a clear statement that you wish to withdraw and enough information to identify the contract. You may use the optional withdrawal notice included in the confirmation or another clear statement. Cancellation of future subscription renewal and statutory withdrawal are separate requests.</p><p>Applicable mandatory rules determine refund amounts, deadlines and any lawful treatment of service already provided. AvenAI’s project policy does not override those rights. The exact documents and your separate request are included in an emailed confirmation and saved copy.</p></section><section class="legal-section"><h2>3. Refund requests</h2><p>Duplicate charges, billing errors, unauthorized charges and service failures will be reviewed in line with applicable law and Stripe records. Statutory refund rights take priority over project policy.</p></section><section class="legal-section"><h2>4. Support</h2><p>Use the <a href="https://github.com/MrSausainis/Aven-AI-Agent/issues">project support tracker</a> for a non-sensitive billing problem. Do not post payment details or other sensitive personal data publicly. A private billing/privacy contact is a required launch item.</p></section></article></div></div></main>
